  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Economic Empowerment in Transport Corridors   2011-2014 - ILO Workplace Policy II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ILO Ekonomisk empowerment i transportkorridorer   2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO&apos;s project aims at preventing new HIV-infections in transport      corridors through six SADC-countries, Southern Africa, with focus on  women and men working in the informal sector. Specific focus will be  to strengthen women&apos;s economic situation. Policy makers and promoters shall be able to make evidence based decisions to mainstream the      economic empowermentmodel into HIV regional and national agendas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ILO-projektet syftar till att minska spridningen av HIV/AIDS i s&#xf6;dra  Afrikas transportkorridorer, fr&#xe4;mst bland kvinnor och m&#xe4;n som arbetar inom den informella sektorn. S&#xe4;rskild betoning ligger p&#xe5; att st&#xe4;rka   kvinnors ekonomiska situation. Programmet skall genomf&#xf6;ras i 6        SADC-l&#xe4;nder. Programmet &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning av tidigare Sidast&#xf6;tt      projekt.</narrative>
  </description>
